reagent-name-hyper-noblium = hyper-noblium
reagent-desc-hyper-noblium = An extremely inert noble gas that stops all reactions around it.

reagent-name-nitrosyl-plasmide = nitrosyl plasmide
reagent-desc-nitrosyl-plasmide = A compound formed in the blood by heavy nitriatium inhalation. Grants immunity to stuns and sleep while it lasts.

reagent-name-proto-nitrate = proto-nitrate
reagent-desc-proto-nitrate = A highly reactive gas that is, surprisingly, not toxic to breathe.

reagent-name-helium = helium
reagent-desc-helium = An inert, invisible noble gas. Completely useless.

reagent-name-halon = halon
reagent-desc-halon = A fire-suppressing gas. Breathing it slows you down heavily but makes you fireproof.

reagent-name-zauker = zauker
reagent-desc-zauker = An incredibly lethal gas. Breathing even a little of it is a death sentence.

reagent-name-antinoblium = anti-noblium
reagent-desc-antinoblium = A exotic gas. Extremely hard to synthesize.
